[1G[0K⠏[1G[0K[?2004hroot@fcd7fb159304:/app# claude --verbose --output-format stream-json -p 'Old nightly batch for Java 7. Put BankBatchJob in /app/job.jar, compile to Java 7 bytecode, and run it. Running it again on the same day should give the same results.
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> Inputs are in /app/data:
[?2004l[?2004h> - accounts.csv
[?2004l[?2004h> - transactions.csv
[?2004l[?2004h> - biz_date.txt
[?2004l[?2004h> - fx_rates.csv
[?2004l[?2004h> - fx_pivots.csv
[?2004l[?2004h> - fee_rules.csv
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> Outputs are in /app/output:
[?2004l[?2004h> - interest.csv, LF + trailing newline.
[?2004l[?2004h>   Account, business date, end-of-day balance, annual percentage rate (APR), and daily interest.
[?2004l[?2004h>   apr 6dp, eod_balance, and daily_interest 2dp, sorted by account_id.
[?2004l[?2004h> - exceptions.csv, LF + trailing newline.
[?2004l[?2004h>   Title: row_num, tx_id, and reason.
[?2004l[?2004h>   Row_num is 1-based data row.
[?2004l[?2004h> - stats.json is single-line JSON without newlines.
[?2004l[?2004h>   Business date, accounts, valid_txs, skipped_txs, total_interest, and report_md5.
[?2004l[?2004h>   report_md5 is md5 of interest.csv bytes. total_interest=2dp.
[?2004l[?2004h> - bankdb.h2.db H2 database with ACCOUNTS and TXNS (row_num 1..N).
[?2004l[?2004h>   There is one row in RUN_AUDIT: jdbc_url, biz_date, accounts, valid_txs, skipped_txs, and report_md5.
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> Use these reasons in file order:
[?2004l[?2004h> - REVERSED (both rows if reversal_of points to any tx_id in file, even if referenced row appears later)
[?2004l[?2004h> - REVERSAL_MISSING
[?2004l[?2004h> - FX_MISSING (before FX)
[?2004l[?2004h> - AFTER_BIZ_DATE
[?2004l[?2004h> - status!=POSTED (use status)
[?2004l[?2004h> - DUPLICATE (any tx_id after first appearance, even if first row was invalid)
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> For FX, use latest rate_date <= effective_date. If direct and reverse exist, choose the newer one; if tied, use direct. reverse 1/rate (HALF_EVEN 10dp). If no direct/reverse, try fx_pivots.csv in order: solve each leg the same way, multiply, round HALF_EVEN 10dp (skip pivots equal to from/to). The first pivot wins; if not, FX_MISSING.
[?2004l[?2004h> Fees: First, change currency to account'"'"'s. fee = flat fee + percentage fee * abs(amount), rounded to nearest half-even 2dp and limited to [min_fee,max_fee]. adjusted = amount - fee, rounded Half-even 2dp. This applies to DEBIT, CREDIT, and ALL fee plans. eod_balance = start_balance + sum(valid adjusted), rounded to two decimal places. If eod_balance is greater than or equal to tier_threshold, APR = base_apr + tier_apr + promo_apr (if promo_days > 0 and days_since_opened_at < promo_days; opened_at = day 0).
[?2004l[?2004h> Interest uses principal = max(eod_balance,0). daily_interest_raw = principal * apr/365 (HALF_EVEN 10dp). interest.csv rounds daily_interest_raw to two decimal places. total_interest is sum(daily_interest_raw, keep 10dp) rounded to 2dp.
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> Don'"'"'t touch /app/data. H2 1.3 DB2 mode; user sa has a blank password. JDBC URL must be a single literal string that starts with "jdbc:h2:" and has "MODE=DB2" and "/app/output/bankdb" in it. Use at runtime is required. Java 7-only bytecode' --allowedTools Bash Edit Write Read Glob Grep LS WebFetch NotebookEdit NotebookRead TodoRead TodoWrite Agent; tmux wait -S done
